Real reverse lookups from China, the US, Australia, Germany, Norway and Japan, limited to the labels the mapping uses (92 address parts, an insubstantial extract under the ODbL). Against the previous lists two of them differ: Shanghai's neighbourhood is now the quarter Lujiazui instead of Lujiazui Subdistrict, and the hamlet West Kill now fills the neighbourhood.

